  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-slippy-slide-skates-v8-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "c6b77bafa148349b7251916da711b194e0f9f509971c6900ceae90fe47408cf0",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e04bc23660277de6977d8f4b3324b82364f781ca427361e7685c0b26088e965a",
      "text": "悟空\n学滑冰",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "73653d595242ffae28fb255b608acdee2b9ccf813199ee3796cfa8f7c50587a7",
      "text": "悟空看着大家滑来滑去。\n“哇，滑得像飞一样！\n我也想试试！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2ece0ecd9c663eb4d43d96d2dfcc53e02f7fe4a61c71c9ef107ee97e8189f7ab",
      "text": "他穿上冰鞋。\n咚，咚，走两步。\n“咦，像踩着小雪橇！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "267e67089175c4d7c5067d4f225d888f6db9955f394da2713d0129da5ee173e1",
      "text": "戴好头盔，戴好手套。\n水獭教练检查好冰鞋。\n“准备好迈小步了吗？”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "55e9f03fb8e98f688e69a5eb0456d1547f434d59756b3ccb52b076ca051f3275",
      "text": "悟空走上冰面。\n两只脚滑开了。\n“哎哎，两只脚，别跑呀！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3ac5a29006bc8b52a051ec33db5e65c752a5239f72b91874c60f2b46a4a72f06",
      "text": "哎哟！他摔了一跤。\n一屁股坐在冰上。\n“屁股凉冰冰的！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ea27c77af60637dbcba93e9dddb7940f199e1953168b7480f1fb5855c108f9fa",
      "text": "“刚学都会晃，别着急。”\n水獭教练说，\n“来，我们一起站起来。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a23f8719a28304cd144ad9ffe638810b2b410bbda5f0865aef69ebd61eaa010a",
      "text": "迈小步，弯膝盖。\n“像小企鹅！”玉兔说。\n悟空一摇一摆，咯咯直笑。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1a14d8be245a1f045801273715293aae6f060a47b4b06f5ba685dc7c0279f801",
      "text": "蹬……滑……\n蹬……滑……\n滑出去一点点！\n又滑出去一点点！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "052257f2f6238439d7dd4392c8fa74bb895c3e0e43b57e958b5da7ed8c2eff15",
      "text": "接着，他又摔了一跤。\n“我还以为已经学会了呢。”\n他坐到八戒旁边。\n“和我一起歇歇吧。”八戒说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "99af0ae17dadc34f0dd32970672b1f45b1484180f696464a206b069735247c51",
      "text": "他们搓搓小手，\n看雪花轻轻地转着圈。\n“我要再试一次。”悟空说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "82007f674076e25f37fdf021d3304e12246f5a5aeafac5acbebce693b1ba482f",
      "text": "悟空回到冰上，接着练。\n迈一小步，滑一小下，\n摇摇晃晃也没关系。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "919192ced2eeeacba43fba64701be9c8ade08428dc53d26ae98b40e04da92385",
      "text": "练着练着，\n悟空滑得越来越稳了。\n蹬一下，滑一段。\n“快看！我会滑啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ccaec8e5827a7cd4ef91a9d1f9788c6bd8ac0e397cb0742916d038a4ffe6187a",
      "text": "玉兔在前，八戒跟着，\n悟空也慢慢滑起来。\n三个人绕了个圈，\n一路笑个不停。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9eaa7da565efd46f7f3592b056868d456eff104d58e744e20903e5e397ea4cd8",
      "text": "冰场的灯一闪一闪。\n悟空腿都酸了，\n脸上还乐呵呵的。\n“下次还来！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "659196ffcb041b6adcbf7c90020955a661659efa20038b06b3324546bab88051",
      "text": "悟空钻进被子里。\n梦里，\n他滑过一颗颗星星，\n慢慢地，轻轻地，\n一直滑进梦乡。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
